=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>≤</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>0.87</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1.10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>≤</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>0.87</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Z</mi><mo>≤</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1.10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Φ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>0.87</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Φ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1.10</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.1922</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.1357</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.0565</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore,</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"357\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D443 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D44B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2248\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>37</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.057</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Note: Using a software package for the approximation gives a probability of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"358\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c39\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0.0569</mn><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
