e\">(</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>30</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.568</mn><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\nNote: Using a software package for the approximation gives a probability of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"548\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0.5646</mn><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
